dual-buffer: keep repacked CPU weights also in the host buffer (original format)

Adds --dual-buffer / LLAMA_ARG_DUAL_BUFFER (and --dual-buffer-pattern,
--dual-buffer-limit). Ported from csaki89/llama.cpp (dual-buffer branch,
based on e14a77971) to the b11351 pin. Must be applied after 001 and 002
(they touch common.cpp/.h, llama.h and llama-context.cpp as well).

